    {
      "text": "the Lord will fulfill his word, 1 Ne. 20:14. God’s law must be fulfilled, 2 Ne. 9:17 (25:24; Alma 34:13; 3 Ne. 1:25). the Lord will fulfil his promises, 2 Ne. 10:17. prophecies of Isaiah1 shall be fulfilled, 2 Ne. 25:7 (3 Ne. 16:17; 20:11). Nephites look forward to Christ until law shall be fulfilled, 2 Ne. 25:24. the Lamb baptized by water to fulfil all righteousness, 2 Ne. 31:5. great and last sacrifice shall fulfill law of Moses, Alma 34:13. words of prophets, scriptures begin to be fulfilled, Hel. 16:13–14. law not yet fulfilled, 3 Ne. 1:25. prayers of holy ones shall be fulfilled according to their faith, 3 Ne. 5:14. in Christ is law of Moses fulfilled, 3 Ne. 9:17 (12:46; 15:5). three Nephite disciples to live until all things shall be fulfilled, 3 Ne. 28:7. by faith all things are fulfilled, Ether 12:3.",
